            "body": "Note for triage: while root-causing a separate runtime issue in the same codebase (which turned out to be our own `wraparound=False` misuse, not Cython), we confirmed THIS compile-time crash is independent and still reproduces on 3.3.0 with the minimal 2-line repro above — the two are unrelated. Leaving this open.",
